original_translation.text:
{cmd:7F090000FF}{cmd:7F1A},{cmd:7F0308}
do any of your friends live
outside {cmd:7F2F}{cmd:7F0306}...
{cmd:7F0900000B}{cmd:7F0304}in another town?{cmd:7F04}{cmd:7F090000FF}
{cmd:7F02}If they do,{cmd:7F0306} you can visit
their town,{cmd:7F0306} or have them
come here to visit you{cmd:7F0304}
instead,{cmd:7F0306} {cmd:7F1C}.{cmd:7F04}
{cmd:7F02}{cmd:7F09000015}Always playing in the same
town{cmd:7F0306} would get boring,
wouldn't it,{cmd:7F0306} {cmd:7F1C}!{cmd:7F04}
{cmd:7F02}To visit another town,{cmd:7F0306}
go to the {cmd:7F504BA00007}station and
catch a train,{cmd:7F030C}
{cmd:7F1C}.{cmd:7F04}
{cmd:7F02}To ride the train,{cmd:7F0306}
you need something called
a {cmd:7F50198CDC0E}Controller Pak.{cmd:7F04}
{cmd:7F02}Please remember that,{cmd:7F0306}
{cmd:7F1C}.{cmd:7F04}
{cmd:7F02}When you visit another town,{cmd:7F0306}
its {cmd:7F504BA0000E}bulletin board{cmd:7F0306}
is a fun place to write{cmd:7F0306}
anything you like,{cmd:7F0306} {cmd:7F1C}.{cmd:7F04}
{cmd:7F02}{cmd:7F0900000E}People who visit
that town later{cmd:7F0308}
will read what you wrote,
{cmd:7F1A}{cmd:7F0304}.{cmd:7F09000015}{cmd:7F04}
{cmd:7F02}Write anything{cmd:7F0304}
you'd like lots of people{cmd:7F0308}
to read,{cmd:7F0306}
{cmd:7F1C}.{cmd:7F04}
{cmd:7F02}{cmd:7F090000FF}Of course,{cmd:7F0306}
the {cmd:7F504BA0000E}bulletin board here{cmd:7F0304}
works the very same way,
{cmd:7F0306}{cmd:7F1C}!
{cmd:7F00}
